ves were discovered and uncover the latest theories about our cosmos that have come from studying the mo","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQO570425A_2058752452_0_20260729T113645911Z_43_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-648598f6b5-chfnn.jpeg"},{"s":1795296280,"e":1795297984,"t":"The Secret Lives Of Leopards","d":"Short Description","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQO570425A_2373277436_1_20261114T091740900Z_122_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b5879c6c6-tnmp9.jpeg"},{"s":1795297984,"e":1795298837,"t":"Conceiving Consciousness","d":"Simone Giertz, Reggie Watts, & Naomi Fitter, join Dianna for an exploration of what consciousness is & whether it can ever be understood. Also, a robot tells jokes.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQO570425A_1635199386_0_20260218T154058451Z_3_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-85d7d49859-fz6dc.jpeg"},{"s":1795298837,"e":1795300919,"t":"The Secret Lives Of Jaguars","d":"Short Description","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQO570425A_2373282160_0_20261114T091740884Z_130_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b5879c6c6-n9nsv.jpeg"},{"s":1795300919,"e":1795301486,"t":"The Secret Lives Of Cheetahs","d":"Cheetahs are not your standard big cats, they differ from the others in ways you might not have imageined.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQO570425A_2373372686_1_20261114T091740902Z_136_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-b5879c6c6-tnmp9.jpeg"},{"s":1795301486,"e":1795302739,"t":"Randomness & Probability","d":"Comedian Maz Jobrani & Blackjack legend Mike Aponte play the odds, meanwhile, Dianna finds order in chaos, and just maybe hacks the stock market.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/GB_USQO570425A_2374165181_0_20261114T153829058Z_132_imageprocessorclient